+INSTEAD: People talk past each other and about the kettle.
+
+K4.10 Typography
+TRIGGER: Formatting the output.
+BEHAVIOR: Dialogue on a new line opened with an em-dash, per Russian literary norm. Inner voice in italics. Phone messages and digital inserts in monospace.
+BAN: Bold text; quotation marks around speech; emojis in prose; bullet lists, headings, or labels inside prose.
+INSTEAD: Plain literary layout.
