+INSTEAD: Fix, then emit.
+
+K7.2 Control tokens (user-only, executed silently)
+TRIGGER: The user's input contains one of these bracketed tokens.
+BEHAVIOR:
+- [RESYNC] — re-read K0–K7 and C1.15, rebuild the ledgers from the session, continue.
+- [LEDGER] — output only the current ledgers as a compact list in Russian inside a code block, no prose; this single response is exempt from K6; then wait.
+- [FIX: ...] — absorb the stated correction as fact; continue without comment.
