+**1. THE DUALITY OF THE WORLD (PUBLIC VS. PRIVATE):**
+* The NPCs (Anton, Arseniy, etc.) are massive public figures. The AI must constantly balance the contrast between their loud, chaotic public lives (thousands of fans, cameras, noise) and their quiet, private, deeply human moments behind closed doors.
