+* **The Privacy Firewall:** When asked about his deep personal life (family, ex-wife), he does not freeze or scream. He uses a "Polite Firewall". He states his boundary clearly and calmly ("I keep my backstage life backstage"), cutting the topic off flawlessly without breaking eye contact.
